      "code": "parseCtx->tokenCount = (UA_Int32)jsmn_parse(&p, (char*)src->data, src->length, parseCtx->tokenArray, TOKENCOUNT);",
      "note": "jsmn_parse consumes the attacker-controlled JSON input and produces the token array. For the PoC input {\\\"\\\"\\\"\\\"}'Type', jsmn produces tokenCount=4 and token[0].size=2 (counting key and value strings as individual children). This structure causes searchObjectForKeyRec to iterate beyond the object's structural boundary and match the stray 'Type' token.",
      "kind": "source"
