      "file": "src/ua_types_encoding_json.c",
      "function": "searchObjectForKeyRec",
      "line": null,
      "code": "",
      "note": "After finding the key 'Type' at the last valid token (index=3), the code increments parseCtx->index to 4 without checking whether 4 < parseCtx->tokenCount. The out-of-bounds index 4 is then stored in *resultIndex and returned as a valid result. The fix adds a bounds check: if (parseCtx->index >= parseCtx->tokenCount) return UA_STATUSCODE_BADOUTOFRANGE.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
